    11	The global client/types and shared/types packages are retired, without replacement catch-all packages or compatibility exports. Splits use direct imports to the actual owner. Billing presentation fields remain in surfaces/subscription; wire enums and billing data belong to schema/account. Store interfaces are separated from legacy mutation/filter wire contracts. Markdown validation and responsive text truncation leave shared utilities for their frontend owners.
